<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-15484] SQL allows &quot;create index&quot; query with duplicated columns</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15484</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This query should forbid such queries and raise an exception:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;create index IDX on table (id ASC, id DESC);&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now it creates index last appearance of the field, in this case (id DESC).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
